## 🔹 Ansible — Install MariaDB

---
- name: Install MariaDB for Pathnex
  hosts: all
  become: yes

  tasks:
    - name: Install MariaDB
      yum:
        name: mariadb-server
        state: present

    - name: Start MariaDB
      service:
        name: mariadb
        state: started
        enabled: yes



